  "scope": "Concrete Rotation240 box-runtime witness and unconditional finite checker soundness in arbitrary ISigma1 models. Two actual modern parents: Execution9/9 and Endpoints8/10. The four runtime fields are proved from exact numeric machine endpoints. Finite external syntax/fuel, arbitrary internal values, gaps, extra spares and positive execution clocks. No internal-variable symbolic fuel, complete dispatch/control iteration or internal PA endpoint.",
